{"summary":"Teslagrad is an electromagnetic 2D puzzle-platformer.","description":"In the Kingdom of Elektropia, a king rules with an iron fist, combating and destroying a sect of technological wizards who have a massive tower in the middle of the city named Teslagrad.\n\nTeslagrad is a 2D puzzle-platformer with action elements where magnetism and other electromagnetic powers are the key to go throughout the game, and thereby discover the secrets kept in the long abandoned Tesla Tower. Embark on an adventure as a young boy armed with ancient Teslamancer technology. Forge your path through the Tesla Tower and overcome the huge variety of challenges and enigmas.\n\nReleased first on PC with over 1,6 million copies sold, we’re proud to share with you this experience carefully adapted for mobile devices. \n\nMain Features: \n● Hand-made graphics / Unique Art Style\n● Innovative gameplay with different mechanics to unlock\n● Visual storytelling! No texts, just the game and you\n● Old-school boss fights!\n● One time payment to download (Absolutely NO ads and NO in-app payments)\n● Optimized for NVIDIA SHIELD and Android TV\n●  Support of external controllers\n●  Haptic and FPS unlock options\n\nIf you experience any issue with Teslagrad, please contact our customer support at hello@playdigious.com and give us as much information as possible on your problem.","esrbNotes":"Mild Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-ZOatc67ZKM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XB72D2sbyJYLmtY2TE7uFTTpETfjpDo1yII054eeNbVO0PQ8dMoQK9s8ea11aYQP8uMNQeF96zY6L_ldmh26iqE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DFiDQpLBAirWK00jxCPeUamp9TPL1mce7Pxq494m6LEe1FD9GHa0ty0DNvqaf4hEJzvSHeyRAazD8JfSCIUpa7E","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vB2Pml4BvhutoBhXnCSZiBAWvl4WduhA4iSmP_joCMG4JqIeKLooOkNgA4xYjryb9YDk7H8g9gZkxQg1groZfUA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Sylz5d5KY